      {
        "id": 13328,
        "name": "AlexxKay",
        "username": "AlexxKay",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/59ef9b/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-07-19T16:19:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>If you want to look into the history of your game in detail (especially useful for figuring out variant unlocks), you might want to look at (and share) your log file.&nbsp; This is a text file that lists every event in the game, in plain english.&nbsp; It includes a lot of redundancy, so it may not be EASY to read, but the information is all there.<br><br>Finding log files by system:<br><br>STEAM/Windows:<br>C:\\Users\\&lt;USERNAME&gt;\\AppData\\LocalLow\\Handelabra Games Inc_\\Sentinels<br><br>iOs:<br>This is a little complicated, because Apple doesn't like people looking at files<br>* Download a copy of iExplorer from here: https://www.macroplant.com/iexplorer/<br>(It looks like running in demo mode is fine if this is all you're using the program for, so you probably needn't buy a registration code).<br>* Go to Apps -&gt; Sentinels -&gt; Documents.<br>* Right-click on log.txt and select \"Export to Folder...\"<br><br>Android:<br>Android/data/com.handelabra.Sentinels/files/log.txt</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:45:05.928Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
        "quote_count": 0,
        "incoming_link_count": 4,
